==Mauville City==
[[File:Mauville City E.png|thumb|Mauville City]]

[[Mauville City]] is located in central [[Hoenn]], situated between Routes {{rtn|110|Hoenn}}, {{rtn|111|Hoenn}}, {{rtn|117|Hoenn}}, and {{rtn|118|Hoenn}}. Tourist hotspots include the [[Mauville Gym]], [[Mauville Game Corner|Game Corner]], and [[Rydel's Cycles]].

