===Pokémon Day Care===
The [[Pokémon Day Care]] is a facility that raises Pokémon for busy Trainers. For a small fee, up to two Pokémon can be left here to be raised by the Day Care staff. During their stay, Pokémon will gradually level up and learn new moves. When two {{DL|Pokémon breeding|How to breed|compatible}} Pokémon are left at the same time, you may return to find an [[Pokémon Egg|Egg]]! Speak to the Day-Care Man and he will hint at the odds of finding one.

