===Reunion===
Enter the cave through either {{rt|116|Hoenn}} or [[Verdanturf Town]]. With the {{badge|Dynamo}}, you can finally use {{m|Rock Smash}} to clear a path through [[Rusturf Tunnel]]. Step inside and go northwest to reach a group of cracked rocks. Clear the debris to open the tunnel and reunite [[Wanda]] with her hardworking boyfriend. As thanks, he gives you {{HM|04|Strength}}!

